 "shape": {
  "shape": "One headquarters. Satellites only where the headquarters can't give a resident its land.",
  "residents_policy": "Left open: any companion may retire to the ranch, stay with family, go back to the wild or go with the rival. Nobody is assigned; the census counts every companion as a possible resident.",
  "stock_policy": "Build the lineage, keep only the final product: one male of each target line who knows the whole egg-move set (the stud). The fathers used along the way are not kept. A line whose move comes from a held item keeps the item instead.",
